OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for #75m hotel project on
OL,4,Alandmark site
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #75m hotel development could
OL,7,Frevitalise a landmark harbourside site
OL,8,Fthat has been derelict for more than
OL,9,Ffive years, according to a council
OL,10,Fleader.
OL,12,FTorbay Council wants to get planning
OL,13,Fpermission for a 150-bedroom hotel on
OL,14,FThe Strand in Torquay which would
OL,15,Finvolve the demolition of some
OL,16,Fbuildings including the old Debenhams
OL,17,Fstore.
OL,19,FThe council says it would then look to
OL,20,Fwork with a developer and a hotel firm
OL,21,Fto deliver the project which it says
OL,22,Fwould be "a gamechanger" for the town.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
