OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for #75m hotel project on
OL,4,Alandmark site
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is opposition to the scheme with
OL,7,FHistoric England expressing concern and
OL,8,Fthe Torbay Civic Society saying the
OL,9,Fproposed development would be too big
OL,10,Fand not in keeping with the surrounding
OL,11,Farea.
